  "worked_solution": "We distribute the conjunction over the disjunction, as follows:\n\n$$\nP\u2227(Q\u2228R)\u2261(P\u2227Q)\u2228(P\u2227R)\n$$\n\nNow, since $P\u2227Q\u2261Q\u2227P$ and $P\u2227R\u2261R\u2227P,$ we can write\n\n$$\n(P\u2227Q)\u2228(P\u2227R)\u2261(Q\u2227P)\u2228(R\u2227P).\n$$",
